        "original_id": "c98b37b1-8d50-5edd-ad12-fe30f071114f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Breach\n- People: Billy Ray, Adam Mazer, William Rotko, Robert Hanssen, Eric O'Neill, Ryan Phillippe\n- Organizations: FBI\n- Topics: espionage, filmography\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Hanssen was born on April 18, 1944.\n- From 1979 to 2001, FBI agent Robert Hanssen spied against the United States for Soviet and Russian intelligence services for 22 years.\n- Breach is a 2007 American historical and political thriller film directed by Billy Ray.\n- The screenplay for Breach was written by Billy Ray, Adam Mazer, and William Rotko.\n- Breach is based on the true story of Robert Hanssen and Eric O'Neill, Hanssen's assistant who helped bring about Hanssen's downfall.\n- In the 2000s, Ryan Phillippe appeared in Breach (2007) among several other films.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
